      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s8"
      },
      "text": "The malware establishes persistence and sends HTTP requests to the command and control domain mailsinfo[.]net.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_12",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s12"
      },
      "text": "These “extended-capability” samples called out to an additional command and control domain, stikerscloud[.]com.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_14",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s14"
      },
      "text": "Identifying another KASPERAGENT campaign We didn’t start out looking for KASPERAGENT, but a file hit on one of our YARA rules for an executable designed to display a fake XLS icon - one way adversaries attempt to trick targets into thinking a malicious file is innocuous.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_16",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s2"
      },
      "text": "We detonated the file in VxStream’s automated malware analysis capability and found testproj.exe dropped a benign Microsoft Word document that pulls a jpg file from treestower[.]com .",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_17",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "Malwr.com observed this site in association with another sample that called out to mailsinfo[.]net - a host identified in the Targeted Attacks in the Middle East Using KASPERAGENT and MICROPSIA blog.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_21",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s1"
      },
      "text": "These additional samples behaved similarly to the initial files; testproj.exe dropped benign decoy files and started malicious executables.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_33",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "ThreatConnect_KASPERAGENT-Campaign-resurfaces-May-Election(06-14-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 5,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p5_s2"
      },
      "text": "Starting with 195.154.110[.]237 , the IP address which is hosting the command and control domain windowsnewupdates[.]com, we found that the host is on a dedicated server.",
